span></span></span>","key":"wA922njb8V"},{"type":"text","value":". A partir de los residuos estandarizados obtenidos al dividir los retornos observados entre la volatilidad estimada, se extraen los cuantiles empíricos correspondientes al nivel de confianza deseado y se proyectan sobre los retornos futuros, para luego transformarlos a niveles de precio mediante la relación exponencial ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"al8ENKveDa"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"P_t = P_{t-1}\\exp(r_t)","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t = P_{t-1}\\exp(r_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>","key":"ul0KldiWE4"},{"type":"text","value":". Este enfoque semiparamétrico evita imponer una distribución cerrada como la normal, captura asimetrías y colas pesadas presentes en los datos históricos y adapta el ancho de la banda de forma dinámica según el régimen de volatilidad.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"OQYdgaDUdC"}],"key":"bFAc80KHZU"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"En el gráfico de bandas de predicción para el modelo TCN, la banda sombreada acompaña la trayectoria del precio real ampliándose cuando aumenta la volatilidad pronosticada y estrechándose en tramos de mayor calma. De este modo, el intervalo se ajusta de manera dinámica a los cambios en la dispersión esperada del mercado, permitiendo evaluar visualmente cuándo el precio realizado permanece dentro del corredor proyectado y en qué episodios puntuales los movimientos bruscos superan los límites estimados.","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"OFnElfUcQu"}],"key":"Ins8dkey6d"}],"identifier":"5d05fbda-cc66-4c29-aae9-204e339a35c3","html_id":"5d05fbda-cc66-4c29-aae9-204e339a35c3","key":"DdAhZyR2uD"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"DATA_PATH = PROJECT_ROOT / \"data\" / \"processed\"\ndf_test = pd.read_parquet(DATA_PATH / \"brent_test.parquet\")\ndf_test.index = pd.to_datetime(df_test.index)\n\nclose_col = next(\n    (c for c in df_test.columns if c.lower() in {\"close\", \"adj_close\", \"adj close\", \"price\"}),\n    None,\n)\nif close_col is None:\n    raise KeyError(f\"No se encontró columna de cierre en brent_test.parquet: {list(df_test.columns)}\")\n\ntcn_col_idx = models_loaded.index(\"TCN\")\nvar_pred_tcn = preds_matrix[:, tcn_col_idx]\nprices_aligned = df_test.reindex(dates_test)[close_col].to_numpy(dtype=float)\n\ndf_tcn_bands = ts.plot_price_prediction_bands(\n    dates=dates_test,\n    prices_true=prices_aligned,\n    pred_volatility=var_pred_tcn,\n    is_variance=True,\n    alpha=0.05,\n    method=\"fhs\",\n    title=\"Bandas de Predicción en Precio (TCN)\",\n)","key":"q0rL01Is7k"},{"type":"outputs","id":"ylpLTXeq5gZm33mLwzLWZ","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"output_type":"display_data","metadata":{},"data":{"text/html":{"content_type":"text/html","hash":"de9ebc0715a00ee725775dc2ac515579","path":"/brent-crude-nlp-market-dynamics/_public/de9ebc0715a00ee725775dc2ac515579.html"},"text/plain":{"content":"<IPython.core.display.HTML object>","content_type":"text/plain"}}},"children":[],"key":"X5qtWRgwaN"}],"key":"qVrQlQ0aXI"}],"identifier":"fc5aec98-054f-45c4-80e5-1659b7b068c6","html_id":"fc5aec98-054f-45c4-80e5-1659b7b068c6","key":"SrUmg4mdJg"}],"key":"WguVkt2fCB"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Band Causal TCN: Entrenamiento y Evaluación","short_title":"Band Causal TCN","url":"/band-causal-tcn","group":"Predicción de Volatilidad del Crudo Brent"}}},"domain":"http://pre.render"}